menu "ESP32 PhotoFrame"

config PHOTOFRAME_AP_PORTAL_ONLY
    bool "Run as an offline AP portal"
    default n
    help
        Start a password-protected PhotoFrame access point on interactive
        wakes and serve the normal portal at 192.168.4.1. Timer and Rotate
        button wakes stay offline and rotate images from local storage.

config PHOTOFRAME_AP_TX_POWER_QUARTER_DBM
    int "AP maximum transmit power (0.25 dBm units)"
    depends on PHOTOFRAME_AP_PORTAL_ONLY
    range 8 84
    default 32
    help
        Maximum AP transmit power in 0.25 dBm units. The default, 32, is
        8 dBm for nearby access. ESP-IDF and the radio's regulatory calibration may clamp
        the effective value to a lower legal maximum.

endmenu
